{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a0a0a0a0a0a0a0a0","type":"text","x":-400,"y":-40,"width":400,"height":80,"color":"6","text":"# AI Agent 状态机工作流\n\n核心：用工程化结构把 Agent 拉回正轨\n来源：25 篇文档"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b1b1","type":"group","label":"Part A 核心概念","x":-1100,"y":-300,"width":500,"height":600,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c1c1c1c1c1c1c1c1","type":"text","x":-1080,"y":-260,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"**1. 为什么需要状态机**\n\nLLM 不可控 vs 生产可预测性"},
		{"id":"c2c2c2c2c2c2c2c2","type":"text","x":-830,"y":-260,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"**2. FSM 基础**\n\n五元组: 状态/事件/转移/守卫/动作"},
		{"id":"c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3","type":"text","x":-1080,"y":-130,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"**3. 范式对比**\n\nFSM / ReAct / Plan-and-Execute"},
		{"id":"c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4","type":"text","x":-830,"y":-130,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"**4. 主流实现**\n\nLangGraph / CrewAI / AutoGen"},
		{"id":"c5c5c5c5c5c5c5c5","type":"text","x":-955,"y":0,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"**5. 核心机制**\n\nState / Node / Edge / Command / Send"},
		{"id":"b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2","type":"group","label":"Part B 实战示例","x":-1100,"y":320,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d1d1d1d1d1d1d1d1","type":"text","x":-1080,"y":360,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**6. 基础工作流模式**\n\nchaining/parallel/routing/worker/eval"},
		{"id":"d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2","type":"text","x":-830,"y":360,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**7. 完整代码示例**\n\nStateGraph + Send + Loop"},
		{"id":"d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3","type":"text","x":-955,"y":490,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**8. 多 Agent 协作**\n\nSubgraphs 父子图通信"},
		{"id":"b3b3b3b3b3b3b3b3","type":"group","label":"Part C 工程实战","x":100,"y":-300,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"e1e1e1e1e1e1e1e1","type":"text","x":120,"y":-260,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"**9. 防跑偏机制**\n\n6 层防御栈"},
		{"id":"e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2","type":"text","x":370,"y":-260,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"**10. 持久化与恢复**\n\nPostgres + Time Travel"},
		{"id":"e3e3e3e3e3e3e3e3","type":"text","x":245,"y":-130,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"**11. 可观测与调试**\n\nLangSmith + PagerDuty"},
		{"id":"b4b4b4b4b4b4b4b4","type":"group","label":"Part D 选型速查","x":100,"y":320,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1","type":"text","x":120,"y":360,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"6","text":"**12. 框架对比表**\n\nLangGraph / CrewAI / AutoGen"},
		{"id":"f2f2f2f2f2f2f2f2","type":"text","x":370,"y":360,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"6","text":"**13. 决策树**\n\n按步骤/工具/性能选型"},
		{"id":"f3f3f3f3f3f3f3f3","type":"text","x":245,"y":490,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"6","text":"**14-15. 坑点 & 趋势**\n\n10 个坑 + Chartering"}
